"{\n  \"reasoning\": \"Itail=55\u00b5A gives total I=110\u00b5A \u2192 P=363\u00b5W (<400\u00b5W). gm1 = (gm/Id)_1 * Itail/2 = 10*27.5\u00b5A = 275\u00b5S \u2192 GBW = gm1/(2\u03c0CL)=275\u00b5S/(2\u03c0\u00b72pF)=21.9MHz (>20MHz). With L1=0.5\u00b5m (gm/gds\u2248174) gds2\u22481.58\u00b5S. Choose PMOS L3=1\u00b5m, (gm/Id)_3=20 \u2192 gm3=20*27.5\u00b5A=550\u00b5S, gm/gds\u2248650 \u2192 gds4\u22480.85\u00b5S. Gain \u2248 gm1/(gds2+gds4)=275\u00b5S/2.43\u00b5S\u2248113 (\u224842dB>40dB). Mirror pole f_p=gm3/(2\u03c0\u00b72pF)=43.8MHz\u22482\u00d7GBW \u2192 PM\u224860\u00b0. Output swing \u2248 VDD\u2011Vdsat4\u2011(Vtail+Vdsat2) \u22483.3\u20110.2\u2011(0.2+0.2)=2.7V>1.5V.\",\n  \"gmid1\": 10,\n  \"L1_um\": 0.5,\n  \"gmid3\": 20,\n  \"L3_um\": 1.0,\n  \"gmid5\": 10,\n  \"L5_um\": 0.5,\n  \"Itail_uA\": 55\n}"